$result = mysqli_query($conn, $sql);

if (mysqli_num_rows($result) > 0) {
  // User authenticated
  // ... (further actions)
} else {
  // Invalid credentials
}
?>
```

**The Attack:**

An attacker could modify the input field to include malicious SQL code:

```
Username: <input type="text" name="username"><br>
